	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『あなをほるは　いっしゅんで
どうくつの　いりぐちに　とべる　わざ▼
ということは　いま　つかわれると
ぼくたち　ばらばらに　なっちゃうよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-05T11:58:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『あなをほるは　一瞬で
洞穴の　入り口に　飛べる　技▼
ということは　今　使われると
ぼくたち　ばらばらに　なっちゃうよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T05:37:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・禁則処理：わざ「あなをほる」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
