				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>森で　暮らす　ポケモンたちも
木漏れ日が　好きだと　いいのにね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T09:13:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
